43: Descaled `SCALE = 10⁴`; `liquidationFactor = 9000`, `storeFrontPriceFactor = 5000`,
44: `assetPrice = 50000`, `basePrice = 10000`, all scales `10⁴`.
45: | input | output |
46: |---|---|
